{"3110700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Space War Economy Idle", "steam_appid": 3110700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space War Economy Idle is an incremental game where you take control of a  mining outpost, extract resources, build ships, and battle your way back towards Earth. It is designed to be casual but complex, working with both passive/idle play-styles and more active playing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two thirds economic management</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configure  - setup machine processes to mine, smelt, craft, and do logistics runs automatically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage - make the processes work in sync and be rewarded for peak performances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle - resources accumulate whether or not the game is active or open</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade - processes can be upgraded almost endlessly and runs can be reset for semi-permanent rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize - master a minigame that rewards management consistency with global multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft - all items are custom with random modifiers based off of what items are consumed in the crafting</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One third permadeath auto-battler</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble - combine component items to create a fleet with action RPG itemization and stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto battle - dispatch fleets to fight challenging enemies in 300 levels of space warfare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer - more items, mechanics, and story are unlocked with battle progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prosper - discover your past and what happened to humanity</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space War Economy Idle is an incremental game where you take control of a  mining outpost, extract resources, build ships, and battle your way back towards Earth. It is designed to be casual but complex, working with both passive/idle play-styles and more active playing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two thirds economic management</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configure  - setup machine processes to mine, smelt, craft, and do logistics runs automatically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage - make the processes work in sync and be rewarded for peak performances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle - resources accumulate whether or not the game is active or open</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade - processes can be upgraded almost endlessly and runs can be reset for semi-permanent rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize - master a minigame that rewards management consistency with global multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft - all items are custom with random modifiers based off of what items are consumed in the crafting</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One third permadeath auto-battler</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble - combine component items to create a fleet with action RPG itemization and stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto battle - dispatch fleets to fight challenging enemies in 300 levels of space warfare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer - more items, mechanics, and story are unlocked with battle progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prosper - discover your past and what happened to humanity</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A story-driven incremental game with idle and auto-battler mechanics, inspired by Factorio logistics, Path of Exile itemization, and Eve Online's economy", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110700/897c08479624a9733bc4e4161cea3faeb40a5bca/header.jpg?t=1760530010